[
  {
    "section": "Executive Summary",
    "content": "Disha Samiti, registered in 2013, presents this proposal for improving educational infrastructure and attendance in Gadchiroli district, Maharashtra. The project aims to benefit 5,600 primary school children over a timeline of 23 months. The target outcome is to raise average daily attendance from 51% to 64%."
  },
  {
    "section": "Project Interventions",
    "content": "To achieve our goals, planned work includes building separate toilets for girls and boys at schools to ensure sanitation and dignity, alongside establishing digital classrooms with projectors and offline learning content to modernise education."
  },
  {
    "section": "Budget and Financial Request",
    "content": "The grant sought is Rs 15,50,000. The detailed budget breakdown is as follows: books and teaching aids Rs 4,33,000; community mobilisers Rs 3,51,000; teacher training Rs 2,53,000; building repairs Rs 4,00,000; and admin and reporting Rs 1,13,000."
  }
]
